# Project Rules

## Original Game
- `/p41` contains a complete, running Phaser demo game that is very old
- This folder should only ever be used as a reference or a source, never changed

## New Game
- `/p41-conversion-working` is the folder for a new version of the old game
- It uses Phaser version 3.90 (included in the site assets - do not change)
- It starts with a demo game called snake
- All work should be done in the `site/game/` folder only

## Common Technology
- Phaser is the common ground
- Game files are originally in JS, keep it that way for now (overrides lower level rules but that is ok for this time)

## Goal
- At the end of this project, `/p41-conversion-working` will contain a complete, running game demo
  - It will contain all features of the old game
  - The layout size and assets may be changed
- The web site build and structure will not have changed

## Starting Process
- Begin bringing over one part of the old game at a time
